> grant role writer@app to bob
granted writer@app to "bob" (config version 3)
> user describe bob
user:  bob
status: enabled
roles:  [reader@app, writer@app]
epoch:  1
created: <TIMESTAMP>
password changed: <TIMESTAMP>
> revoke role writer@app from bob
revoked writer@app from "bob" (config version 4)
> grant access to app for bob
Error: the 'access' form is not supported; grant a role instead:
  grant role writer@app to bob
